  "description": "Reveal 06 Force eTap AXS – this bike is absolutely high-end. The ultra clean, comfortable frame of the Reveal family, made up of a mere 920 grams of carbon, meets SRAM’s Force eTap AXS wireless shifting to delight even the most demanding bike enthusiasts! Savour this again: Long-distance design paired with multiple technical highlights. The Reveal is a mile eater with a stack-to-reach ratio that is clearly trending towards comfort. The riding position is compact, but not too upright. Deep seatstays and a full-integrated clamping of the comfortable ROSE D-shape seatpost provides you with various flex-levels and seating positions for the comfort you need on long distances. The top tube runs neatly and elegantly into the ½\" to 1 ½\" head tube construction that ensures the right stiffness and the power transfer resulting from it. Uncompromising design DNA can be found at the front, too. We have given it a great facelift! Internally routed brake cables give the cockpit even more elegance and skills: Features, such as the outstanding stiffness values thanks to a wide handlebar clamp, a faceplate that is compatible with a Garmin mount, and a stem cap with flat top surface integrated in the design, round off the all-in-one ROSE Square stem. SRAM’s Force eTap AXS promises incomparable shifting performance – precise, quiet and secure. With its own app, the system allows for extended possibilities for customisation as well as a profound analysis of the performance data of your bike. X-Range gives you a wider range of gears and a narrower gear ratio to make sure the right gear is available at all times. The high-quality ROSE RC Forty/Fifty Disc Carbon wheels are the perfect complement – for fast acceleration and extreme resilience. They are adapted for the Force disc brake, which itself guarantees an untroubled and safe riding experience, thanks to perfect braking power modulation. * approx. 7.5 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt carbon/shiny laser gray frame, size 57 cm, without pedals *Slight paint variances are possible at the fork.",
